{"seq":3,"slug":"window-counters","title":"固定与滑动窗口计数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations/window-counters","wordCount":1846,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"固定与滑动窗口计数\">固定与滑动窗口计数</h1><p>当限流规则被写成「每分钟最多 60 次」时，工程师脑子里浮现的往往不是令牌桶，而是一个更朴素的画面：拿个计数器，每来一次请求加一，到 60 就拒绝，每分钟清零。这就是固定窗口计数——最容易实现、也最容易出错的限流算法。它在窗口边界上藏着一个能让实际流量翻倍的陷阱。这一篇从这个陷阱讲起，看滑动窗口如何用更多存储把它补上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>窗口类算法都围绕「在一段时间里你已经用了多少次」这个计数视角展开，几个关键概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>固定窗口</strong>：把时间切成对齐的格子、每格一个计数器，实现只需一个 <code>INCR</code> + <code>EXPIRE</code>，但只保证「格子内不超限」。</li>\n<li><strong>边界双倍陷阱</strong>：请求堆在窗口翻转两侧，跨边界的任意 60 秒区间里实际放行可达限额的 2 倍。</li>\n<li><strong>滑动日志</strong>：记录每个请求时间戳，给出数学精确的窗口计数，但存储与计算随请求量线性增长。</li>\n<li><strong>滑动窗口计数</strong>：只留「当前格 + 上一格」两个计数，按位置加权 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">count = c_{cur} + c_{prev}\\cdot(W-e)/W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近精确值，是高频通用限流的默认选择。</li>\n<li><strong>取舍坐标</strong>：精确度、存储成本、突发处理三维权衡；精确优先选滑动日志，通用选滑动窗口计数，需突发则选令牌桶。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话串起来：<strong>窗口算法用「存多少、算多准」交换边界精度，固定窗口最省但会被边界双倍击穿，滑动窗口计数是精确与廉价的平衡点</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"固定窗口-简单背后的边界陷阱\">固定窗口：简单背后的边界陷阱</h2><p>固定窗口把时间切成等长的格子（如每分钟一格），每格一个计数器，请求落在哪格就给哪格加一，超过阈值就拒绝，进入下一格时计数清零。实现只需一个 key 和一个带过期的自增操作，在 Redis 里就是 <code>INCR</code> 配 <code>EXPIRE</code>，原子又廉价。这种极致的简单是它至今仍被大量使用的原因。</p>\n<p>但它的致命缺陷在窗口边界。假设阈值是每分钟 60 次。一个客户端在 12:00:59 这一秒发了 60 次（用满当前窗口），紧接着在 12:01:00 窗口刚翻转、计数清零后又发 60 次。从任意一个真实的 60 秒滑动区间（12:00:30 到 12:01:30）来看，它在这一分钟里实际发了 120 次——是限额的两倍。固定窗口只保证「每个对齐的格子内不超限」，却不保证「任意 60 秒内不超限」，攻击者只要把请求堆在边界两侧就能稳定地拿到双倍流量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W1[窗口 12:00:00-12:00:59&lt;br/&gt;计数上限 60] --&gt; B1[12:00:59 集中发 60 次]&#10;  W2[窗口 12:01:00-12:01:59&lt;br/&gt;计数清零重新计] --&gt; B2[12:01:00 集中发 60 次]&#10;  B1 --&gt; CROSS[跨边界 60 秒区间&lt;br/&gt;12:00:30 - 12:01:30]&#10;  B2 --&gt; CROSS&#10;  CROSS --&gt; RESULT[实际放行 120 次&lt;br/&gt;是限额的 2 倍]\">graph TD\n  W1[窗口 12:00:00-12:00:59&lt;br/&gt;计数上限 60] --&gt; B1[12:00:59 集中发 60 次]\n  W2[窗口 12:01:00-12:01:59&lt;br/&gt;计数清零重新计] --&gt; B2[12:01:00 集中发 60 次]\n  B1 --&gt; CROSS[跨边界 60 秒区间&lt;br/&gt;12:00:30 - 12:01:30]\n  B2 --&gt; CROSS\n  CROSS --&gt; RESULT[实际放行 120 次&lt;br/&gt;是限额的 2 倍]</pre><h2 id=\"滑动日志-精确但昂贵\">滑动日志：精确但昂贵</h2><p>要彻底消除边界问题，最直接的办法是滑动日志（sliding log）：为每个 key 记录每一次请求的精确时间戳，判断时把窗口长度以外的旧时间戳剔除，再数剩下的条数是否达到阈值。它给出的是数学上精确的「任意窗口内计数」，没有任何边界放大。</p>\n<p>代价也很直白——存储与计算都随请求量线性增长。一个高频 key 在一分钟窗口里可能积累成千上万个时间戳，每次判定都要做一次范围裁剪。用 Redis 的有序集合（ZSET）实现时，每次请求要 <code>ZREMRANGEBYSCORE</code> 清理过期、<code>ZADD</code> 加入新时间戳、<code>ZCARD</code> 取计数，内存占用与窗口内请求数成正比。对低频、需要绝对精确的场景（如严格的计费配额）滑动日志合适，但对高频限流它太重了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滑动窗口计数-精确与廉价之间的折中\">滑动窗口计数：精确与廉价之间的折中</h2><p>滑动窗口计数（sliding window counter）是工程上最常用的折中。它不记录每个时间戳，而是保留固定窗口的「当前格」和「上一格」两个计数，然后按当前时刻在格子里的位置，对上一格做加权估算。设窗口长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，当前已进入当前格的时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\leq e &lt; W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>），当前格计数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{cur}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、上一格计数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{prev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则估算的滑动计数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mi>W</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">count = c_{cur} + c_{prev} \\cdot \\frac{W - e}{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：刚跨入新格时（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0），上一格几乎完整地仍在滑动窗口内，权重接近 1；随着时间推移（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>），上一格逐渐滑出，权重线性降到 0。这个加权假设上一格内请求是均匀分布的——这是它与滑动日志相比的唯一近似来源。实践中这个近似的误差很小：Cloudflare 公布过其滑动窗口计数实现的误差率，在真实流量下绝大多数情况下偏差远低于 1%，却把存储从「每请求一条」压到了「每 key 两个整数」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (sw *SlidingWindow) Allow(now int64, limit int) bool {&#10;    cur := now / sw.windowMs          // 当前窗口序号&#10;    if cur != sw.curWindow {          // 跨窗口：当前格变上一格&#10;        sw.prevCount = 0&#10;        if cur == sw.curWindow+1 {&#10;            sw.prevCount = sw.curCount&#10;        }&#10;        sw.curCount = 0&#10;        sw.curWindow = cur&#10;    }&#10;    elapsed := float64(now%sw.windowMs) / float64(sw.windowMs)&#10;    estimated := float64(sw.curCount) + float64(sw.prevCount)*(1-elapsed)&#10;    if estimated &lt; float64(limit) {&#10;        sw.curCount++&#10;        return true&#10;    }&#10;    return false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SlidingWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sw.windowMs          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 当前窗口序号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sw.curWindow {          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 跨窗口：当前格变上一格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sw.prevCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sw.curWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sw.prevCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sw.curCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sw.curCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sw.curWindow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sw.windowMs) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sw.windowMs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    estimated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sw.curCount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sw.prevCount)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">elapsed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> estimated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(limit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sw.curCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"四种算法的取舍坐标\">四种算法的取舍坐标</h2><p>把窗口类算法和上一篇的桶类算法（见 <a href=\"token-leaky-bucket\">令牌桶与漏桶算法</a>）放进同一张取舍表，能看清各自落点。核心维度是：精确度、存储成本、对突发的处理方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>边界精确度</th>\n<th>每 key 存储</th>\n<th>突发处理</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定窗口</td>\n<td>差（边界双倍）</td>\n<td>1 个计数</td>\n<td>边界可突发 2 倍</td>\n<td>粗粒度、容忍误差的配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动日志</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>与请求数成正比</td>\n<td>严格无突发放大</td>\n<td>低频、需绝对精确的计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口计数</td>\n<td>近似精确（误差 &lt;1%）</td>\n<td>2 个计数</td>\n<td>平滑、无明显边界突发</td>\n<td>高频通用限流的默认选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td>—（非窗口语义）</td>\n<td>1 计数 + 1 时间戳</td>\n<td>显式可控的突发 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>需主动允许突发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中的默认建议是：通用 API 限流首选滑动窗口计数，它几乎拿到了滑动日志的精确度而只花固定窗口的存储；只有当业务明确需要「允许攒额度的突发」时才换成令牌桶；固定窗口仅用于对精度不敏感的粗粒度场景；滑动日志留给计费这类不容半点误差的地方。这些窗口算法搬到多副本环境时，「计数放哪、谁来加权」会引出分布式一致性问题，那是 <a href=\"../distributed/distributed-rate-limiting\">分布式限流与一致性</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>固定窗口实现最简（Redis 一个 <code>INCR</code> + <code>EXPIRE</code>），但在窗口边界存在双倍突发陷阱：攻击者把请求堆在边界两侧可拿到 2 倍限额。</li>\n<li>滑动日志记录每个请求时间戳，给出数学精确的窗口计数，但存储与计算随请求量线性增长，只适合低频、需绝对精确的场景。</li>\n<li>滑动窗口计数用「当前格 + 上一格加权」的公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">count = c_{cur} + c_{prev}(W-e)/W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近精确值，每 key 只需两个整数、误差通常低于 1%，是高频通用限流的默认选择。</li>\n<li>选型坐标：精确度、存储成本、突发处理三维权衡；通用限流选滑动窗口计数，需突发选令牌桶（见 <a href=\"token-leaky-bucket\">令牌桶与漏桶算法</a>），计费选滑动日志。</li>\n<li>这些算法进入多节点环境后会面临计数放置与一致性问题，详见 <a href=\"../distributed/distributed-rate-limiting\">分布式限流与一致性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"固定与滑动窗口计数","id":"固定与滑动窗口计数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"固定窗口：简单背后的边界陷阱","id":"固定窗口-简单背后的边界陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动日志：精确但昂贵","id":"滑动日志-精确但昂贵"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口计数：精确与廉价之间的折中","id":"滑动窗口计数-精确与廉价之间的折中"},{"level":2,"text":"四种算法的取舍坐标","id":"四种算法的取舍坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"令牌桶与漏桶算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations/token-leaky-bucket"},"next":{"title":"背压原理与传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure/backpressure-principles"}}